48776). Does not hydrolyze AMP and GMP (PubMed:12234496). Involved in proteoglycan synthesis (PubMed:22539336)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}